  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Boil the kettle.\n• Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Slice brown onion (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-8e806336.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place potato, cauliflower and onion on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning, drizzle generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• Remove veggies from oven and set aside to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-6ddefebc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Toast pearl couscous, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Half-fill the saucepan with boiling water. Bring to the boil, then simmer, uncovered, until tender, 10-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-a48a5b23.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and return couscous to the pan with the salt and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-55abc0aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, roasted veggies, couscous and basil pesto. Season to taste with salt and pepper. TIP: Add the salad and roasted veggies to the couscous saucepan and toss everything together in there to save on washing up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-0422ceae.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby nourishing cauliflower pearl couscous between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds and drizzle over dill & parsley mayonnaise to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66b2e988a0c907afd08f5259-91edad17.jpeg"
    }
  ]
